      "message": "if I run the original benchmark with 100,000 iterations:\n```\nDEBUG:Running benchmark_unaligned_access_array...\nDEBUG: (speed gain: 453134 -\u003e 410472 us)\nDEBUG:OK\nDEBUG:Pass!\n```\nwhich is equivalent to (453,134 - 410,471)/(20*100,000) \u003d 0.021331 usec \u003d 2.13 extra cycles for unaligned access vs. aligned access. This is in par with your measurement (677216-250115)/(20*1000000)\u003d 0.02134405 usec or 2.13 cycles for the 100MHz blonchipper.\n\nI can definitely use your approach if you believe if it better.",
